# The JavaScript runtime library, in load order. Read by `jsl-load-index!`.
#
# THE ORDER IS PART OF THE FORMAT. A declaration's position here becomes its closed-world function
# index, which appears in every printed graph and every golden hash, so this file is an explicit
# list rather than a directory scan whose order would be the filesystem's. Names resolve across the
# whole table, so a unit may call one that appears below it.
